    "letter":  {
                   "title":  "A Letter to My Baby Bodin",
                   "greeting":  "Bodin my Baby,",
                   "paragraphs":  [
                                      "Almost 25 years together... and somehow you are still my favorite person to argue with about absolutely nothing.",
                                      "I honestly thought by now we\u0027d be calm, mature adults who handle disagreements with wisdom and grace. Instead, we still debate like it\u0027s a competitive sport. Bu I guess we both both are just very passionate. We have Olympic-level stamina for teasing each other, misunderstanding each other, and then laughing about it five minutes later.",
                                      "You drive me crazy. And somehow, that is still one of my favorite places to be.",
                                      "You are demanding - yes, you are. You always want to be treated like a baby. You want to be taken care of. You want attention. You want cuddles. You want reassurance. You want to feel assurance every single day. You want to feel chosen every single day.",
                                      "And the truth is... I love that about you.",
                                      "I love that you want all of that from me. It annoys me like crazy. But it also makes me feel so special. It makes me feel like the most important person in the world to you.",
                                      "Because it means I am your safe place. It means I\u0027m the one you trust to hold you when you\u0027re tired. It means I\u0027m the one you expect to show up.",
                                      "And I always have and I will always be there..",
                                      "You are gorgeous. Not just \"pretty.\" Not just \"cute.\" Gorgeous.",
                                      "For almost 25 years, I still look at you and think, \"How did I get this hot, sexy woman to choose me?\" The way you smile. The way you laugh when I tell the worst corny joke. The way you look at me when you\u0027re annoyed but still secretly entertained. The way you pout when your lips form that little expression that says, \"You better fix this.\"",
                                      "You are stunning. Yes, physically - that part is undeniable and unfairly impressive for me even though you don\u0027t agree. I don\u0027t care!- but even more in the way you carry yourself. Your determination. Your standards. The way you protect what\u0027s yours. The way you fight for our family like a viking warrior.",
                                      "You demand the best from me - even when I don\u0027t want to give it. And because of you, I grow. Because of you, I try harder. Because of you, I am not the same man I was 25 years ago.",
                                      "You make me better. Even when your lips are pouting at me about something small. Even when you\u0027re giving me that look that says I messed up. Even when you\u0027re refolding the clothes that I already folded.",
                                      "You sharpen me. You steady me. You challenge me.",
                                      "And you love me.",
                                      "Thank you for loving me. The stubborn one. The immature one. The quiet one. The loud one. The one who pretends he doesn\u0027t care but cares deeply. The version of me that was still figuring life out. The version that made mistakes. The version that didn\u0027t always say the right thing.",
                                      "Through all of it... you stayed.",
                                      "You chose me. Again and again. Not just on easy days - but on the complicated ones. On the tired ones. On the \"we\u0027re not talking right now\" ones.",
                                      "That kind of love isn\u0027t luck.",
                                      "That\u0027s commitment. That\u0027s loyalty. That\u0027s real.",
                                      "If I had to start over - if I had to relive every argument, every blanket stealing battle, every snoring war, every cleanliness inspection and memory lapse disagreement - I would still pick you.",
                                      "Every time.",
                                      "Not because we\u0027re perfect.",
                                      "But because we\u0027re us.",
                                      "And behind all the sarcasm and teasing, here\u0027s the truth I don\u0027t joke about:",
                                      "You are my home. You are my comfort. You are my fire. You are my peace. You are my chaos and my calm. You are my baby.",
                                      "And after 25 years, I don\u0027t love you out of habit.",
                                      "I love you with intention.",
                                      "I love you because I see you. I know you. And I choose you.",
                                      "For as long as I breathe, I will keep choosing you - on the loud days, on the quiet days, on the annoying days, on the passionate days.",
                                      "Even if you steal the blankets first.",
                                      "I love you. Happy Valentine\u0027s Day, Baby."
                                  ],
                   "closing":  "Forever yours,",
                   "signature":  "Papi"
               }
}
